# Normalize every text file to LF in the repo and on checkout, so Windows,
# macOS, and Linux checkouts all produce identical bytes and Prettier's
# `endOfLine: "lf"` check stays green everywhere. `text=auto` leaves
# detected binaries alone; common binary types are guarded explicitly.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
